  "title": "Mindset of a Champion",
  "contentHtml": "<figure class=\"post-image tf_clearfix\">\n\t\t\t    \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/on-mindset-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/images/attla/2011/12/1980-slideshow1.jpg\" class=\"wp-post-image wp-image-452 attla-content-img\" title=\"George Attla 1982\" alt=\"George Attla 1982\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    \t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    \t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"post-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2012-06-01\" class=\"post-date entry-date updated\">June 1, 2012</time>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"post-title entry-title\"><a href=\"/on-mindset-2\">Mindset of a Champion</a></h1>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"post-meta entry-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"post-author\"><span class=\"author vcard\"><a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"/author/kathy\" rel=\"author\">kathy</a></span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"post-category\"><a href=\"/category/highlight\" rel=\"category tag\">highlight</a>, <a href=\"/category/main\" rel=\"category tag\">main</a></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\n        \t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1929\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-1929\" class=\"wp-caption alignright\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"><a href=\"/images/attla/2012/06/1982.02-Smith-Kirby-of-George-run-of-RondyCC-smaller.jpg\"><img class=\"size-thumbnail wp-image-1929 attla-content-img\" title=\"1982.02-Smith, Kirby of George run of RondyCC-smaller\" src=\"/images/attla/2012/06/1982.02-Smith-Kirby-of-George-run-of-RondyCC-smaller.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-1929\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">1982.02-Smith, Kirby of George run of Rondy</figcaption></figure>\n<p>George Attla says winning is all in the head. He explains a champion always<span id=\"more-455\"></span> gives his or her best and has winning thoughts; it does not mean winning every time. George believes a person with good self-esteem can talk himself or herself into anything. Anyone who can stay on top of their problems by driving their thoughts in a good direction is a winner. He gives Lance Mackey as an example of a musher with a champion mind-set. Every champion thinks&nbsp;<em>win!</em></p>\n<p><em>&nbsp;</em></p>\n<!--themify_builder_content-->\n<div id=\"themify_builder_content-455\" data-postid=\"455\" class=\"themify_builder_content themify_builder_content-455 themify_builder tf_clear\">\n    \t<!-- module_row -->\n\t<div data-lazy=\"1\" class=\"module_row themify_builder_row tb_6rlo860 tb_first tf_clearfix\">\n\t    \t\t<div class=\"row_inner col_align_top col-count-1 tf_box tf_w tf_rel\">\n\t\t\t<div data-lazy=\"1\" class=\"module_column tb-column col-full first tb_b3tl861 tf_box\">\n\t\t\t    \t        <div class=\"tb-column-inner tf_box tf_w\">\n\t\t    <!-- module video -->\n<div class=\"module module-video tb_svgz269 video-overlay  \" data-lazy=\"1\" data-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/L3sCrvijJ-E\">\n    \t\t\t\t<div class=\"video-wrap-outer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"video-wrap tf_rel tf_overflow\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<!-- /video-wrap -->\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<!-- /video-wrap-outer -->\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t        </div>\n\t    \t</div>\n\t\t    </div>\n\t    <!-- /row_inner -->\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- /module_row -->\n\t</div>\n<!--/themify_builder_content-->\n\t    \n\t</div><!-- /.entry-content -->\n\t\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- /.post-content -->"
